('112-4301-058','112-4301',58,'single_choice','Acourt-appointed guardian persuades his twelve-year-old charge to lend him NTD100,000 from his trust fund, free of interest. The loan contract would be unenforceable because of .','unilateral mistake','lack of capacity to make loan contract by a teenager','material misrepresentation','impossibility to perform','法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],9,9,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
('112-4301-059','112-4301',59,'single_choice','Read the following clause from an agreement. What kind of agreement is it? “Employee agrees that he will not (i) disclose to any person, either directly or indirectly, any Confidential Information, unless and solely to the extent that such Confidential Information is required to be disclosed by law or pursuant to a final judicial order or decree, (ii) use for his own account or use, cause, facilitate or allow any third party to use Confidential Information in any way, or (iii) remove any Confidential Information or any copy, summary or compilation of any kind of any Confidential Information from the premises of the Company or the premises of any Company’s customers.”','An employment agreement','An informed consent agreement','A non-competition agreement','A non-disclosure agreement','法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],9,9,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
('112-4301-060','112-4301',60,'single_choice','Danny bought a calf from Happy Farm. After Danny paid, Happy Farm delivered the calf to him. Suddenly, a car rushed out of nowhere and hit the calf. Under Article 373 of R.O.C. Civil Code, Happy Farm is not liable for Danny''s loss because Danny has to undertake the when it delivered the calf to Danny.','crisis','hazaed','risk of loss','risk of lost','法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],10,10,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
('112-4301-061','112-4301',61,'single_choice','Taiwan’s Company Law concerning “Short-Form” merger (parent merges with 90 percent owned subsidiary) relies on to assure dissenting shareholders have the right to opt-out.','proposal rights','appraisal rights','voting rights','information rights','法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],10,10,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
