('112-4301-063','112-4301',63,'single_choice','Which of the following statement about cross examination is INCORRECT under Taiwan Criminal Procedure Code?','Leading questions are not permitted on cross examination.','The scope of cross examination shall be limited to the matters or its related matter revealed in direct examination.','Leading questions may be asked in cross examination if necessary.','Matters in supporting of new allegation by the cross-examiner may be brought out in cross examination with the court’s permission.','法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],10,10,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
